OL,3,GNEWSATerraced street EV charging
OL,4,A'postcode lottery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSean says he breaks the law every time
OL,7,Fhe charges his electric car outside his
OL,8,Fterraced home in Hull because access to
OL,9,Fcharging is a "postcode lottery".
OL,11,FThe 51-year-old bought his EV through
OL,12,Fthe Motability scheme two years ago
OL,13,Fdespite knowing he could not charge on
OL,14,Fhis street, but hoped new
OL,15,Finfrastructure would make it easier for
OL,16,Fpeople without driveways to charge at
OL,17,Fhome.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
