OL,3,GNEWSATerraced street EV charging
OL,4,A'postcode lottery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnable to install a wall-mounted
OL,7,Fcharger because it would require
OL,8,Fcouncil permission, he instead uses a
OL,9,Fcable running across the pavement
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,12,FA Hull City Council spokesperson said:
OL,13,F"Under existing legislation, it is
OL,14,Fillegal to place a rope, wire or
OL,15,Fsimilar apparatus across a highway
OL,16,Fwithout consent."
